  "plain": "A guest named Dylan Borland told podcast host Jesse Michels that if you look through patents for triangle-shaped craft and for gravity control, using Google Patents, a public search site for patents, the trail of power sources and gravity work leads back to the US Air Force and NASA, the US space agency, in the 1950s. If true, it would mean serious government work on controlling gravity goes back some seventy years."
